/104489.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Updated documentation to specify that Texture2DRD is only supported by the global rendering device.\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n\r\nIn ...\r\ntexture_rd.cpp\r\n_set_texture_rd_rid()\r\n\r\nERR_FAIL_COND(!RD::get_singleton()->texture_is_valid(p_texture_rd_rid));\r\n\r\nThis fail condition ensures that the rendering device global singleton owns the RID that is being assigned to the Texture2DRD, and errors if it is owned by another rendering device (is designated as not valid).\r\n\r\nThere are many other instances in texture_rd.cpp that call RD::get_singleton() as well.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104489/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104489/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}